  "comments": "There are many differences between the years (see the overlap):<br />\r\n- 10, year and SEN are more or less low,<br />\r\n- the zero of 10 is more or less wide,<br />\r\n- the margin of the leaves is very indented or almost smooth,<br />\r\n- the right leaf is higher or lower,<br />\r\n- the flower is more or less rotated,<br />\r\n- the veins of the petals are more or less marked,<br />\r\n- the space between the petals is more or less wide,<br />\r\n- the pistil is more or less arched,<br />\r\n- the tip of the pistil is more or less close to the right leaf.<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5f80c4bc69753.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5f80c4bc69753.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"192\" /></a>",
